---
// Welcome to Astro
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width" />
    <title>Welcome to Astro</title>
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 2rem;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #667eea 0%, #764ba2 100%);
        min-height: 100vh;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
      }
      main {
        text-align: center;
        color: white;
      }
      h1 {
        font-size: 3rem;
        margin: 0 0 1rem 0;
      }
      p {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin: 1rem 0;
      }
      .links {
        margin-top: 2rem;
      }
      a {
        color: #fff;
        text-decoration: underline;
        margin: 0 1rem;
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <main>
      <h1>🚀 Welcome to Astro</h1>
      <p>Your project is up and running!</p>
      <div class="links">
        <a href="https://astro.build">Astro Docs</a>
        <a href="https://astro.build/integrations">Integrations</a>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
